msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: en\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: 7b095a69a09e8190786f63266ce7a39b13c6f70f1ba9d9be66e6beb24b99a586\n"

msgid "当前精确支持范围"
msgstr "Current exact support scope"

msgid "本页帮助消费者选择当前维护的精确器件、Board、后端与外设模式。当前事实包含 STM32F405ZGT6、F407VET6、F407ZGT6、F415ZGT6、F417ZGT6、F411RET6、F446ZET6 和 F479NIH6，组成七个器件视图；厂商 SDK 目录的 23 个选择器不等于这八料号的 全部模式资格。实际模式由同一 TOML／typed IR resolver 对器件、封装、Board、 时钟和资源取交集。所选 fixture 的模型、ARM 和最终 clean-source SDK 消费已有 各自执行记录，见 [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) 与 [架构说明](architecture.md#本轮重构退出范围)。物理执行仍为 `not_executed`； 新增器件不继承 F407 专属模式结果，也不据此取得整系列资格。"
msgstr "This page helps consumers select currently maintained exact parts, Boards, backends and peripheral modes. Current facts contain STM32F405ZGT6, F407VET6, F407ZGT6, F415ZGT6, F417ZGT6, F411RET6, F446ZET6 and F479NIH6, forming seven device views. The vendor SDK's 23 selectors do not qualify every mode on these eight parts. The same TOML/typed IR resolver intersects the device, package, Board, clocks and resources. Selected fixtures have separate model, ARM and final clean-source SDK execution records; see [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) and the [architecture description](architecture.md#本轮重构退出范围). Physical execution remains `not_executed`; added parts neither inherit F407-specific mode results nor receive family-wide qualification."

