msgstr "Part, Board and OS boundaries"

msgid "对象"
msgstr "Object"

msgid "精确边界"
msgstr "Exact boundary"

msgid "STM32F407VET6"
msgstr "STM32F407VET6"

msgid "LQFP100，512 KiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、64 KiB CPU-only CCM；只开放该封装实际引出的路线"
msgstr "LQFP100, 512 KiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM and 64 KiB CPU-only CCM; only routes physically exposed by this package are admitted"

msgid "STM32F407ZGT6"
msgstr "STM32F407ZGT6"

msgid "LQFP144，1 MiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、64 KiB CPU-only CCM；额外引脚不自动授权 PCB 接线"
msgstr "LQFP144, 1 MiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM and 64 KiB CPU-only CCM; extra pins do not automatically authorize PCB wiring"

msgid "F405ZG／F415ZG／F417ZG"
msgstr "F405ZG / F415ZG / F417ZG"

msgid "LQFP144、1 MiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、64 KiB CCM；[内部 CRC 软件参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_family/README.md)只使用 HSI16，未声明实体 PCB 或外接振荡源"
msgstr "LQFP144, 1 MiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM and 64 KiB CCM; [internal-CRC software references](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_family/README.md) use HSI16 only and declare no physical PCB or external oscillator"

msgid "STM32F411RET6"
msgstr "STM32F411RET6"

msgid ""
"LQFP64、512 KiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、无 CCM；显式 HSI96 RUN，并保留 direct "
"HSI16；所选 TIM2／CRC 与精确高频配置下 RTC／Power 参考分别校验，不扩展到其它外设模式"
msgstr ""
"LQFP64, 512 KiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM, no CCM; explicit HSI96 RUN with"
" direct HSI16 retained; the selected TIM2/CRC references and RTC/Power "
"references under exact high-frequency configurations are checked "
"separately, without extending support to other peripheral modes"

msgid "STM32F446ZET6"
msgstr "STM32F446ZET6"

msgid ""
"LQFP144、512 KiB Flash、128 KiB 主 SRAM、无 CCM；显式 HSI168 RUN，并保留 direct "
"HSI16；SAI1／2 消费独立 M 的 PLLSAI Q，不开放 LTDC R"
msgstr ""
"LQFP144, 512 KiB Flash, 128 KiB main SRAM, no CCM; explicit HSI168 RUN "
"with direct HSI16 retained; SAI1/2 consume PLLSAI Q with an independent "
"M; LTDC R is not enabled"

msgid "STM32F479NIH6"
msgstr "STM32F479NIH6"

msgid ""
"TFBGA216、2 MiB Flash、320 KiB 主 SRAM、64 KiB CPU-only CCM；显式 HSI168 RUN，并保留"
" direct HSI16；按精确模式开放 FMC／SAI／LTDC／DMA2D／QuadSPI，PLLSAI 共享 M。普通 Flash "
"写擦覆盖两个物理 bank，OPTCR1 维护不受支持"
msgstr ""
"TFBGA216, 2 MiB Flash, 320 KiB main SRAM, 64 KiB CPU-only CCM; explicit "
"HSI168 RUN with direct HSI16 retained; FMC/SAI/LTDC/DMA2D/QuadSPI are "
"enabled by exact mode, and PLLSAI shares M. Ordinary Flash programming "
"and erase cover both physical banks; OPTCR1 maintenance is unsupported"

msgid "启明 ZG Board"
msgstr "Qiming ZG Boards"

msgid "[V3.1](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407_qiming_v31/README.md)、[独立核心板](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407zg_qiming_core/README.md)、[V4.1](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407zg_qiming_v41/README.md) 是三个独立来源和装配身份"
msgstr "[V3.1](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407_qiming_v31/README.md), [standalone core board](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407zg_qiming_core/README.md) and [V4.1](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407zg_qiming_v41/README.md) have three separate source and assembly identities"

msgid "天空星 VE Board"
msgstr "Sky VE Board"

msgid "[天空星青春版](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407ve_sky_qingchun/README.md)；不推广到 VG 高配板或其他 PCB 修订"
msgstr "[Sky Qingchun](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/stm32f407ve_sky_qingchun/README.md); this scope does not extend to the VG high-spec board or other PCB revisions"

msgid "裸机"
msgstr "Bare metal"

msgid "显式选择 `baremetal`；启动不创建调度器或产品任务，调用者推进 service 与停止"
msgstr "Explicit `baremetal` selection; startup creates neither a scheduler nor product tasks. The caller advances service and shutdown"

msgid "FreeRTOS"
msgstr "FreeRTOS"

msgid "静态任务／队列／等待适配；按所选 assembly、实际 IRQ syscall ceiling 和执行上下文接入"
msgstr "Static task / queue / wait adapters; integration follows the selected assembly, actual IRQ syscall ceiling and execution context"

msgid "ThreadX"
msgstr "ThreadX"

msgid "已维护的 M4 适配子集与明确消费者；不继承所有 FreeRTOS 模式组合"
msgstr "The maintained M4 adapter subset and explicit consumers; it does not inherit every FreeRTOS mode combination"

msgid "Native／CPU-only Runtime"
msgstr "Native／CPU-only Runtime"

msgid "Native 是显式 host-test scope；CPU-only Runtime 不提供 SoC 外设，二者都不是 PCB 资格"
msgstr "Native is an explicit host-test scope; CPU-only Runtime supplies no SoC peripherals. Neither establishes PCB qualification"

msgid "引脚、AF、DMA、IRQ、Flash 几何和资源冲突只在 [SoC 事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/soc.json)、 [路线](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/routes.json)、[Board 包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md)及 实际 provider 中维护。本页不复制第二份 pin／DMA 表。软件 fixture 只声明测试路线； 原理图、元件实装、跳线、电压和晶振事实仍须由精确 Board 授权。"
msgstr "Pins, AF, DMA, IRQ, Flash geometry and resource conflicts are maintained only in the [SoC facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/soc.json), [routes](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/routes.json), [Board packages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md) and actual providers. This page does not duplicate pin / DMA tables. Software fixtures declare test routes only; schematics, fitted components, jumpers, voltage and oscillator facts still require exact Board authorization."

msgid "OS 的静态对象、权限、IRQ 和退出要求见 [OS 合同](../design/os-contracts.md)与 [后端入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/README.md)。选择一个后端不自动验证每种外设／低功耗组合。"
msgstr "Static OS objects, privilege, IRQ and exit requirements are defined by the [OS contract](../design/os-contracts.md) and [backend entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/README.md). Selecting a backend does not automatically validate every peripheral / low-power combination."

msgid "F405／F407 共用 DS8626 Rev12，F415／F417 共用 DS8597 Rev10；经典四款器件复用 67 项共同控制器事实，ETH／DCMI 只由 F407／F417 选择，基础 CRYP／HASH 限定 F415／F417。F411、F446、F479 分别绑定独立 RM／ES profile；F446 的 PLLSAI M 独立，F479 与主 PLL 共用 M，同一 System owner 管理所选 Q／R 输出。"
msgstr "F405/F407 share DS8626 Rev12; F415/F417 share DS8597 Rev10. These four classic devices reuse 67 common controller facts. Only F407/F417 select ETH/DCMI; basic CRYP/HASH is restricted to F415/F417. F411, F446 and F479 bind independent RM/ES profiles. F446 has independent PLLSAI M; F479 shares M with the main PLL. One System owner manages the selected Q/R outputs."

msgid "精确 package、IRQ、DMA 和路线仍逐料号检查。F479NI 当前显式 GPIO 名单为 159 项， 与资料摘要 161 项的差异保持未知，不补猜 pad。新料号与 IP 的软件参考不声明 PCB 接线；开发包 `publishable=false`、ARM 对象或单个 ELF 不能代替最终 clean-source 候选及全部消费者。原四板范围不变，全部物理 HIL 保持未执行。"
msgstr "Package, IRQ, DMA and routes are checked per exact part. F479NI currently has 159 explicit GPIO names; the difference from the datasheet summary's 161 remains unknown rather than inventing pads. New-part/IP software references make no PCB-wiring claims. A `publishable=false` development package, ARM object or single ELF cannot replace the final clean-source candidate and every consumer. The original four Board identities are unchanged; all physical HIL remains unexecuted."

msgid "当前模式矩阵"
msgstr "Current mode matrix"

msgid "能力"
msgstr "Capability"

msgid "维护模式与关键边界"
msgstr "Maintained modes and key boundaries"

msgid "权威合同"
msgstr "Authoritative contract"

msgid "冷态与平台归还"
msgstr "Cold lifecycle and platform withdrawal"

msgid "静态 factory 纯查询；手写 C 执行准入、取得、逆序撤回和回读。部分效果、未退出 IRQ／DMA 与失败引脚恢复继续保留原 owner 和收条"
msgstr "Static factory lookups are pure; handwritten C performs admission, acquisition, reverse withdrawal and readback. Partial effects, live IRQ / DMA references and failed pin restoration retain the original owner and receipts"

msgid "[所有权](../explanation/ownership.md)、[F4 实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[Ownership](../explanation/ownership.md), [F4 implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "System／时钟"
msgstr "System / clocks"

msgid ""
"F407 默认 `hse8-pll168`，其余已审 custom HSE／HSI、PLL、总线和 Flash latency 共用 "
"ClockPlanIR。F411 显式 HSI96；F446／F479 显式 HSI168，均保留 direct HSI16。F479 可选 "
"M10／N210 以同时使用共享 M 的 PLLSAI 音频／图形输出；System 先证明 PLLRDY／VOSRDY、prefetch 与 "
"latency，再切换并发布时间。HSI 名义频率不证明 USB 或音频精度。无 180 MHz／overdrive 或运行期 DVFS；新增器件"
" STOP 只按独立已审高频 profile 与唤醒合同开放"
msgstr ""
"F407 defaults to `hse8-pll168`; other reviewed custom HSE/HSI, PLL, bus "
"and Flash-latency configurations share ClockPlanIR. F411 explicitly uses "
"HSI96; F446/F479 explicitly use HSI168; all retain direct HSI16. F479 can"
" select M10/N210 to use PLLSAI audio/graphics outputs with shared M "
"simultaneously; System establishes PLLRDY/VOSRDY, prefetch and latency "
"before switching and publishing time. The nominal HSI frequency does not "
"establish USB or audio accuracy. No 180 MHz/overdrive or runtime DVFS; "
"STOP on added parts is enabled only under separately reviewed high-"
"frequency profiles and wakeup contracts"

msgid "[System 与时钟](../design/f407-system-power.md)"
msgstr "[System and clocks](../design/f407-system-power.md)"

msgid "Sleep／STOP"
msgstr "Sleep／STOP"

msgid ""
"浅 Sleep 保留时间域；F407 既有配置与 F411／F446／F479 精确高频软件参考分别支持受约束 STOP。实际 traits 校验"
" NVIC bank、备份／CCM 和唤醒源，拒绝外来低功耗／debug 状态；排空后进入 STOP，真实 System 恢复才建立新 Core "
"epoch，旧 deadline 不继承。仅 baremetal，elapsed bounds 由调用者提供"
msgstr ""
"Shallow Sleep preserves the time domain; existing F407 configurations and"
" exact high-frequency software references for F411/F446/F479 separately "
"support constrained STOP. Actual traits validate NVIC banks, backup/CCM "
"and wakeup sources, rejecting foreign low-power/debug states; STOP "
"follows drain, and only actual System restoration establishes a new Core "
"epoch. Old deadlines are not inherited. Baremetal only; callers supply "
"elapsed bounds"

msgid "[System 低功耗](../design/f407-system-power.md)、[ClockDomain 屏障](../design/clock-domain-sleep.md)"
msgstr "[System low power](../design/f407-system-power.md), [ClockDomain barrier](../design/clock-domain-sleep.md)"

msgid "Standby"
msgstr "Standby"

msgid ""
"显式 WKUP／RTC 唤醒与同一 RTC owner 的准备收条；F446 另校验 EWUP2／PC13 与晶体 LSE 的冲突。F479 "
"SBF／sticky WUF 阻止 RTC 重入；显式 reset-prepare 只按授权清 SBF，之后产品必须复位，平台不自动复位或清 "
"RTC。真实进入经复位重建启动；虚假返回建立新 Core epoch，restore 失败保留责任"
msgstr ""
"Explicit WKUP/RTC wakeup and a preparation receipt from the same RTC "
"owner; F446 also checks the EWUP2/PC13 conflict with crystal LSE. F479 "
"SBF/sticky WUF prevent RTC re-entry; explicit reset-prepare clears SBF "
"only as authorized, after which the product must reset. The platform does"
" not automatically reset or clear RTC. Actual entry restarts through "
"reset; a spurious return establishes a new Core epoch, and restore "
"failure retains responsibility"

msgid "[System 低功耗](../design/f407-system-power.md)、[RTC 合同](../design/f407-rtc.md)"
msgstr "[System low power](../design/f407-system-power.md), [RTC contract](../design/f407-rtc.md)"

msgid "监督与故障"
msgstr "Supervision and faults"

msgid "IWDG／WWDG 显式启用；可选 WWDG EWI、HSE CSS／NMI、复位原因、首次故障记录与 DWT trace。无自动喂狗、任务重启或旧时间域降频续跑"
msgstr "Explicit IWDG / WWDG activation; optional WWDG EWI, HSE CSS / NMI, reset cause, first-fault record and DWT trace. No automatic feeding, task restart or downclocked continuation in the old time domain"

msgid "[监督与故障](../design/f407-system-power.md)"
msgstr "[Supervision and faults](../design/f407-system-power.md)"

msgid "GPIO／EXTI／PVD"
msgstr "GPIO／EXTI／PVD"

msgid ""
"精确封装全部 GPIO 的 input／output、四档显式输出速度与 EXTI0–15；PVD 原始电平／事件。EXTI 的 "
"`hardware-event` 只产生 EMR 硬件事件，不取得 IRQ 或软件队列。省略速度保留已有配置，PC13–15 输出限制为 "
"LOW；晶振 LSE 占用时 PC13 保持静默，晶振和调试引脚仍受资源约束。单 pin 可显式声明 `active_high`，生成复用授权 "
"port 的只读逻辑 signal；省略时无 signal，不从初始电平推导极性。软件事件保留 "
"COALESCED／LOSS，不提供自动消抖、精确边沿时间或 BOR 资格"
msgstr ""
"Input/output on all GPIOs of the exact package, four explicit output "
"speeds and EXTI0–15, plus raw PVD levels/events. EXTI `hardware-event` "
"produces only EMR hardware events, acquiring no IRQ or software queue. "
"Omitting speed preserves existing configuration; PC13–15 output speed is "
"limited to LOW. PC13 remains quiet when the LSE crystal owns its pads; "
"oscillator and debug pins retain resource constraints. A single pin may "
"explicitly declare `active_high`, generating a readonly logical signal "
"that reuses its authorized port. Omitting it generates no signal; "
"polarity is not inferred from the initial level. Software events retain "
"COALESCED/LOSS; no automatic debounce, precise edge timing or BOR "
"qualification is supplied."

msgid "[F4 GPIO／PVD](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)、[I/O 观察](../design/io-observation-recovery.md)"
msgstr "[F4 GPIO / PVD](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md), [I/O observation](../design/io-observation-recovery.md)"

msgid "UART 数据传输"
msgstr "UART data transport"

msgid "全部六实例：IRQ byte／event、独立 9N1 words、调用者存储的 blocks、有限 HAL TX DMA、有限／连续 RX DMA 和 duplex；各模式分别选择"
msgstr "All six instances: IRQ bytes / events, separate 9N1 words, blocks in caller storage, finite HAL TX DMA, finite / continuous RX DMA and duplex; each mode is selected separately"

msgid "[UART DMA 与 RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)"
msgstr "[UART DMA and RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)"

msgid "UART 线模式"
msgstr "UART wire modes"

msgid "全部六实例支持半双工、LIN、IrDA；同步 master、Smartcard、CTS／RTS 只用于 USART1／2／3／6。RS485 显式组合 DE 与既有传输 owner"
msgstr "All six instances support half duplex, LIN and IrDA. Synchronous master, Smartcard and CTS / RTS are limited to USART1 / 2 / 3 / 6. RS485 explicitly composes DE with the existing transport owner"

msgid "[UART 线模式](../design/uart-wire-modes.md)、[RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)"
msgstr "[UART wire modes](../design/uart-wire-modes.md), [RS485](../design/uart-dma-rs485.md)"

msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

msgid ""
"SPI1／2／3 polling、8／16-bit 分段事务、有限 DMA；`irq-frames` 提供 "
"master／slave、单双线、Motorola／TI 与双线 CRC。F4 polling／recover 只在特权、未屏蔽 Thread "
"执行；preflight 拒绝不写 progress 或控制存储，精确原地收发与部分重叠分别处理。单线 CRC "
"拒绝；主接收精确帧数以声明时序预算成立为条件"
msgstr ""
"SPI1/2/3 polling, 8/16-bit segmented transactions and finite DMA; `irq-"
"frames` provides master/slave, single/dual-line, Motorola/TI and dual-"
"line CRC. F4 polling/recover executes only in privileged unmasked Thread "
"context. Preflight rejection writes neither progress nor control storage;"
" exact in-place transfer and partial overlap are handled separately. "
"Single-line CRC rejects; exact master receive frame counts depend on the "
"declared timing budget."

msgid "[SPI 帧模式](../design/spi-frame-modes.md)、[公共 I/O](../reference/api/io.md)"
msgstr "[SPI frame modes](../design/spi-frame-modes.md), [public I/O](../reference/api/io.md)"

msgid "I2C master"
msgstr "I2C master"

msgid "I2C1／2／3 polling／IRQ／DMA、显式 7／10-bit endpoint；实际时序与 repeated START 勘误共同限制准入；与 target personality 分选"
msgstr "I2C1/2/3 polling/IRQ/DMA with explicit 7/10-bit endpoints; actual timing and repeated START errata constrain admission; selected separately from the target personality"

msgid "[总线恢复](../design/i2c-bus-clear.md)、[F4 I2C](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[Bus recovery](../design/i2c-bus-clear.md), [F4 I2C](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "SMBus packet PEC"
msgstr "SMBus packet PEC"

msgid ""
"可选 `Nexus::SMBus` 复用 7-bit 异步 I2C endpoint 和原强类型 ID；独立 companion 返回原静态 "
"faces 的只读绑定。有限 write／read／write-read；32 B 包含 command／count，外层贷款直到内部 I2C "
"drain 和 PEC 结清"
msgstr ""
"Optional `Nexus::SMBus` reuses a 7-bit asynchronous I2C endpoint and its "
"existing strong ID; a separate companion returns readonly bindings to the"
" existing static faces. Finite write/read/write-read; the 32 B limit "
"includes command/count, and the outer borrow remains until the inner I2C "
"drain and PEC settle"

msgid ""
"[SMBus 组件](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/smbus/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"[SMBus component](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/smbus/README.md)"

msgid "I2C target／SMBus"
msgstr "I2C target/SMBus"

msgid "I2C1／2／3 的 `target-irq` 提供 7／10-bit 自身地址与 7-bit 双地址；`smbus-device` 为 7-bit、至多 100 kHz，可选 PEC／SMBA ARA。每方向至多 256 B、WRITE_READ 合计至多 512 B、最多两个地址阶段；IRQ、无 DMA，响应预计算。PEC 受声明 IRQ 预算约束；ARP／Host Notify 与命令策略由产品提供"
msgstr "I2C1/2/3 `target-irq` provides 7- or 10-bit own addresses and dual 7-bit addressing; `smbus-device` uses 7-bit addresses at up to 100 kHz with optional PEC/SMBA ARA. At most 256 B per direction, 512 B total for WRITE_READ and two address phases; IRQ only, no DMA, with precomputed responses. PEC depends on the declared IRQ budget; products provide ARP, Host Notify and command policy"

msgid "[I2C target 合同](../design/f407-i2c-target.md)"
msgstr "[I2C target contract](../design/f407-i2c-target.md)"

msgid "普通 PWM／capture／encoder"
msgstr "Ordinary PWM / capture / encoder"

msgid "已审 TIM3／4／5／9–14 PWM；TIM1／3／4／5／8／9–14 原始输入捕获，按实例开放 1／2／4 通道，TIM5 保留 32 位；TIM1／3／4／5／8 支持 x2／x4 正交计数。TIM2 保留给 Core，TIM6／7 用作专用触发；timer personality 独占，IRQ 只取得所选模式实际使用的向量"
msgstr "Reviewed TIM3 / 4 / 5 / 9–14 PWM; TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 / 9–14 raw input capture, with 1 / 2 / 4 channels according to the instance and a full 32-bit count on TIM5. TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 support x2 / x4 quadrature counting. TIM2 is reserved for Core and TIM6 / 7 for dedicated triggers. Timer personalities are exclusive; an IRQ lease covers only the vector actually used by the selected mode"

msgid "[定时器合同](../design/timer-advanced.md)、[F4 实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[Timer contract](../design/timer-advanced.md), [F4 implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "互补 PWM"
msgstr "Complementary PWM"

msgid "TIM1／TIM8 的 CH1–3／CH1N–3N、deadtime、break 和显式 rearm；没有自动故障重启或隐式跨 timer 同步"
msgstr "TIM1 / TIM8 CH1–3 / CH1N–3N, deadtime, break and explicit rearm; no automatic fault restart or implicit synchronization across timers"

msgid "[高级定时器](../design/timer-advanced.md)"
msgstr "[Advanced timers](../design/timer-advanced.md)"

msgid "PWM 组／有限波形"
msgstr "PWM groups/finite waveforms"

msgid "单 timer 多通道 CPU group、硬件单脉冲与有限 UPDATE-DMA sequence；实例、TRGO／ITR、break 和 burst 预算显式选择。sequence 成功统计 staged 存储字节，不承诺精确电脉冲数"
msgstr "Multi-channel CPU groups on one timer, hardware one-pulse operation and finite UPDATE-DMA sequences; instances, TRGO/ITR, break and burst budgets are explicitly selected. Sequence success counts staged storage bytes and does not promise exact electrical pulse counts"

msgid "[有限波形合同](../design/f407-timer-waveform.md)"
msgstr "[Finite waveform contract](../design/f407-timer-waveform.md)"

msgid "独立 ADC"
msgstr "Independent ADCs"

msgid "ADC1／2／3 的已审外部输入，ADC1 内部输入；6／8／10／12-bit、regular shot／scan、软件 injected、有限／连续 timer DMA。内部输入与模拟路径有独立启动／退出责任"
msgstr "Reviewed ADC1 / 2 / 3 external inputs and ADC1 internal inputs; 6 / 8 / 10 / 12-bit regular shot / scan, software injected and finite / continuous timer DMA. Internal inputs and analog paths have separate startup / withdrawal responsibilities"

msgid "[F4 ADC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[F4 ADC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "多 ADC／注入采集"
msgstr "Multiple ADCs / injected acquisition"

msgid "`adc_group` 独占 ADC123 域；保留有限 regular／injected 与双／三 ADC 同步或交错，新增对应 regular DBM blocks。同一同步 owner 可接一次软件或独占 Table69 timer 注入；有限 `regular-auto-injected` 用具名 descriptor 联合借用 regular／injected 两个 span，TC＋全部 JEOC＋真实 join 才共同终止。交错 blocks 按原生 CDR 几何、最快吞吐和 service gap 准入，不承诺均匀 aperture。未建立连续 JAUTO 逐次 JDR、交错＋注入或未知外来 trigger 合同。"
msgstr "`adc_group` exclusively owns ADC123. Finite regular/injected and dual/triple simultaneous or interleaved acquisition remain, with corresponding regular DBM blocks added. One simultaneous owner can accept a software or exclusive Table69 timer injection. Finite `regular-auto-injected` jointly borrows two regular/injected spans through a named descriptor and terminates them together only after TC, all JEOC and actual join. Interleaved blocks use native CDR geometry, fastest throughput and service-gap admission without promising uniform aperture. Per-conversion JDR guarantees for continuous JAUTO, interleaved+injected operation and unknown external triggers have no current contract."

msgid "[多 ADC 合同](../design/f407-adc-groups.md)"
msgstr "[Multi-ADC contract](../design/f407-adc-groups.md)"

msgid "DAC"
msgstr "DAC"

msgid "单／双通道 direct、独占 timer、noise／triangle、有限／循环 DMA 与 idle code；可选 EXTI9 event-only 外部触发 CPU／循环 DMA，实际外部 rate 为 unknown，有限外部尾部拒绝。ES0182 恢复可内部转换声明的 idle，随后短时禁输出，不计 payload，不保证请求间模拟连续。"
msgstr "Single/dual-channel direct, exclusive timer, noise/triangle, finite/circular DMA and idle code. Optional EXTI9 event-only external triggering covers CPU/circular DMA; actual external rate remains unknown and finite external tails are rejected. ES0182 recovery may internally convert the declared idle code, then briefly disable outputs. These conversions are not payload progress and do not guarantee uninterrupted analog output between requests."

msgid "[F4 DAC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[F4 DAC](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "DCMI"
msgstr "DCMI"

msgid "RAW／JPEG snapshot、连续 RAW storage blocks，及有限 frames-raw／frames-jpeg CM1 会话。每帧完整 join 后发布并重启，允许间隙和缺 FREE 时 source-off 等待；会话 transferred 统计完整帧前缀。JPEG word padding 不等于码流长度，无 CM0 无缝完整帧。VE 最高 12-bit，ZG 可选 14-bit。"
msgstr "RAW/JPEG snapshots, continuous RAW storage blocks and finite frames-raw/frames-jpeg CM1 sessions. Every frame fully joins before publication and restart, with gaps and source-off waiting without a FREE slot. Session transferred counts the complete-frame prefix. JPEG word padding does not identify codestream length; no gapless CM0 complete frames. VE supports up to 12 bits; ZG may select 14 bits."

msgid "[DCMI／音频合同](../design/f407-capture-audio.md)"
msgstr "[DCMI/audio contract](../design/f407-capture-audio.md)"

msgid "I2S2／3"
msgstr "I2S2／3"

msgid "master／slave × TX／RX／duplex 的有限 DMA 与连续 `*-blocks`；Philips、MSB／LSB justified、PCM short／long，16／24／32-bit 数据。master 显式 PLLI2S，slave 实际外部 rate 为 unknown；连续模式显式声明 rate／service 上界，使用调用者 block 存储，已发布 RX loan 单独归还。不转换音频格式"
msgstr "Finite DMA and continuous `*-blocks` for master/slave × TX/RX/duplex; Philips, MSB/LSB justified, PCM short/long and 16/24/32-bit data. Masters explicitly select PLLI2S; the actual external slave rate is unknown. Continuous modes declare explicit rate/service upper bounds and use caller-owned block storage; published RX loans are returned separately. Audio formats are never converted."

msgid "[音频合同](../design/f407-capture-audio.md)、[有限 slave TX 路径](../design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md)"
msgstr "[Audio contract](../design/f407-capture-audio.md), [Finite slave TX path](../design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md)"

msgid "SAI1／SAI2"
msgstr "SAI1/SAI2"

msgid ""
"F446 的 SAI1／2、F479 的 SAI1：A／B master／slave × TX／RX／同步 duplex，有限与连续 "
"`*-blocks`，8／10／16／20／24／32 有效位、至多 16 wire slots。显式 active mask 只为有效 slot"
" 分配 FIFO 容器，保留原 wire 位置，不做重排。连续模式使用 caller block 存储、声明 SCK／service "
"上界，撤回目标后才发布 RX loan；缺块撤源、失败排空保留责任。master 消费唯一 System PLLSAI Q；slave "
"实际外部速率 unknown。无跨 SAI 同步、AC97／SPDIF 或物理时序保证"
msgstr ""
"F446 SAI1/2 and F479 SAI1: A/B master/slave × TX/RX/synchronized duplex, "
"finite and continuous `*-blocks`, 8/10/16/20/24/32 useful bits and at "
"most 16 wire slots. The explicit active mask allocates FIFO containers "
"only for enabled slots, preserving wire positions without reordering. "
"Continuous modes use caller block storage and declared SCK/service "
"bounds; RX loans are published only after target withdrawal. Missing "
"blocks withdraw the source; failed drain retains responsibility. Master "
"consumes the sole System PLLSAI Q; actual external slave rates remain "
"unknown. No cross-SAI synchronization, AC97/SPDIF or physical timing "
"guarantee is supplied."

msgid "[SAI 与布局](../design/f407-capture-audio.md)"
msgstr "[SAI and layout](../design/f407-capture-audio.md)"

msgid "RTC／备份域"
msgstr "RTC / backup domain"

msgid ""
"`adopt-retained`／`provision-empty`、Alarm A request、Alarm "
"B、wakeup、timestamp、tamper、校准、20 个 backup registers、4 KiB backup SRAM CPU "
"lease 与显式 handoff。PC13 timestamp／tamper 需要 Board 明确授权 LSE bypass；四个现有 "
"Board 的晶体配置不能据 API 存在推定支持。新增 F411／F446／F479 的晶体 LSE primary "
"retained／provision 精确高频参考；F411 有 20 个 backup registers、无 backup SRAM，其 "
"SRAM ops 为 NULL；F446／F479 保留 4 KiB lease。未增加这些料号的 bypass、periodic 或 RTOS "
"组合。不提供世纪／时区或保持性证明"
msgstr ""
"`adopt-retained`/`provision-empty`, Alarm A request, Alarm B, wakeup, "
"timestamp, tamper, calibration, 20 backup registers, a 4 KiB backup SRAM "
"CPU lease and explicit handoff. PC13 timestamp/tamper requires explicit "
"Board authorization for LSE bypass; the API's existence does not "
"establish support under the four existing Boards' crystal configurations."
" Added exact high-frequency references for F411/F446/F479 use crystal LSE"
" primary retained/provision; F411 has 20 backup registers and no backup "
"SRAM, with NULL SRAM ops; F446/F479 retain the 4 KiB lease. No bypass, "
"periodic or RTOS combinations are added for these parts. No "
"century/timezone support or proof of retention"

msgid "[RTC 合同](../design/f407-rtc.md)"
msgstr "[RTC contract](../design/f407-rtc.md)"

msgid "内部 Flash／制造维护"
msgstr "Internal Flash / manufacturing maintenance"

msgid ""
"F407 VE／ZG 的精确 sector 几何及显式 OTP／option／RDP 维护；F479NI 的 2 MiB／24 sectors "
"只提供 poll-word 读写擦，bank2 逻辑编号映射 SNB16–27，拒绝交换映射、BFB2／PCROP 和未审 OPTCR1 "
"维护。F479 按 ES0321 在 pulse 前关闭 DCEN，真实 idle 后 reset／restore；失败保留同一 "
"owner。Flash pulse 不可中止，同 bank 执行可停顿；deadline 不撤销借用。不自动回滚、重放不可逆维护或以软件 "
"reset 代替 POR"
msgstr ""
"Exact F407 VE/ZG sector geometry and explicit OTP/option/RDP maintenance;"
" F479NI 2 MiB/24 sectors provides only poll-word read/program/erase. "
"Bank-two logical sectors map to SNB16–27; swapped mapping, BFB2/PCROP and"
" unreviewed OPTCR1 maintenance reject. F479 follows ES0321 by disabling "
"DCEN before pulses and resetting/restoring cache after actual idle; "
"failures retain the same owner. Flash pulses cannot be aborted and same-"
"bank execution can stall; deadlines do not revoke borrows. No automatic "
"rollback, irreversible-maintenance replay or software-reset substitute "
"for POR is supplied."

msgid "[物理存储与维护](../design/f407-storage.md)"
msgstr "[Physical storage and maintenance](../design/f407-storage.md)"

msgid "SDIO／MMC／I/O functions"
msgstr "SDIO／MMC／I/O functions"

msgid "SD memory／MMC polling、有限 IRQ／DMA；SDIO functions 使用独立 face 的 CMD5／52／53。单卡、3.3 V，SD／SDIO 为 1／4 位，MMC 可显式选择经版本和 SWITCH 检查的 8 位十引脚软件参考。memory 单块 CMD17／24，多块以一次 CMD18／25、CMD12 和 CMD13 READY 结束；combo 不同时维护 memory portion。默认速度使用精确 PLL48 与经 RM／勘误联合验证的分频；另选精确 F407 `hse8-pll150-sdio375`、裸机四位 SD／MMC 37.5 MHz 高速 SDR，须完成 SD CMD6 或 MMC HS52 协商。该 profile 不授予 USB／RNG 或低功耗；不提供其他高速组合、DDR／HS200"
msgstr "SD memory/MMC polling and finite IRQ/DMA; SDIO functions use CMD5/52/53 through a distinct face. One card at 3.3 V; SD/SDIO uses one/four bits, and MMC may explicitly select the eight-bit, ten-pin software reference after version and SWITCH checks. Memory single-block operations use CMD17/24; multiblock operations finish one CMD18/25 with CMD12 and CMD13 READY. Combo operation does not simultaneously maintain the memory portion. Default speed uses exact PLL48 and divider constraints checked against the reference manual and errata. The optional exact F407 `hse8-pll150-sdio375` profile supports baremetal four-bit SD/MMC 37.5 MHz high-speed SDR after SD CMD6 or MMC HS52 negotiation. This profile grants no USB/RNG or low-power modes; no other high-speed combination, DDR or HS200 is provided"

msgid "[SDIO 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/sdio_hal/README.md)"
msgstr "[SDIO contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/sdio_hal/README.md)"

msgid "FSMC"
msgstr "FSMC"

msgid "运行期 CPU window、永久 startup SRAM、parallel16，以及显式 PSRAM、有限 NOR program／erase、raw NAND／OOB／ECC 码；bank 与 mux／burst／WAIT 按封装和所选模式授权，无 FTL 或自动纠错"
msgstr "Runtime CPU windows, permanent startup SRAM, parallel16, explicit PSRAM, finite NOR program / erase and raw NAND / OOB / ECC codes. Banks and mux / burst / WAIT require package and selected-mode authorization; no FTL or automatic error correction"

msgid "[FSMC 合同](../design/f407-fsmc.md)、[存储边界](../design/f407-storage.md)"
msgstr "[FSMC contract](../design/f407-fsmc.md), [storage boundaries](../design/f407-storage.md)"

msgid "FMC SDRAM"
msgstr "FMC SDRAM"

msgid "F479NI Bank1、8 MiB、16-bit、row12／column8；默认 CPU 数据窗口不授予 DMA。显式 `graphics-owned` 通过 `memory_window` 引用，仅给所选 LTDC 只读、DMA2D 读写区域，共同保留原始 bank lease 直至冷退出。两种模式均检查七组时序、上电／刷新／自刷新等待与原 System epoch；WFDIS 共享约束在取得 gate 后实际观察。不授予启动 RAM、XIP、自动 MPU 或实装 RAM 时序资格"
msgstr "F479NI Bank1, 8 MiB, 16-bit, row12/column8. The default CPU data window grants no DMA access. Explicit `graphics-owned` connections through `memory_window` references grant readonly regions only to the selected LTDC and read/write regions to DMA2D, jointly retaining the original bank lease until cold exit. Both modes check seven timing groups, power-up/refresh/self-refresh waits and the original System epoch; the shared WFDIS constraint is actually observed after acquiring the gate. Neither startup RAM, XIP, automatic MPU setup nor qualification of installed RAM timing is granted"

msgid "[FMC／外部存储](../design/f407-fsmc.md)"
msgstr "[FMC/external memory](../design/f407-fsmc.md)"

msgid "QuadSPI／串行 NOR"
msgstr "QuadSPI/serial NOR"

msgid "F479NI＋W25Q128JV Flash1、24-bit SDR 1-1-1；PIO 读／program／4 KiB erase。可选 `qspi-indirect-dma` 仅把 page-program 的 payload 交给 DMA2 Stream7 Channel3，读／status／verify 保持 PIO；PIO 不分配 DMA 可变扩展。memory TC、QSPI idle、NOR WIP 与 SETTLED 分别证明；取消和失败排空保留贷款。公共 async stop 保留 PREPARED，Platform cold stop 才归还硬件。可选 W25Q128JVSIQ 六 pad、6Bh／8 dummy 的 1-1-4 quad read，与 program DMA 独立；接管须 QE=1、SUS=0，不写状态或恢复外来 suspend。间接 Flash 端点整个生命周期禁止访问 0x90000000 aperture。另选 `mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` 仅与 PIO 控制器组合，静态分配 1..8 reader slots，只授权 live CPU loan 范围；无 Flash 旁路 face、DMA reader 或 XIP。最后释放失败只保留清理，不能继续读取；不提供 DDR／dual 或自动保护修改"
msgstr "F479NI + W25Q128JV Flash1, 24-bit SDR 1-1-1; PIO read/program/4 KiB erase. Optional `qspi-indirect-dma` transfers only page-program payload through DMA2 Stream7 Channel3, while read/status/verify remain PIO; PIO allocates no mutable DMA extension. Memory-transfer TC, QSPI idle, NOR WIP and SETTLED each require separate proof; cancellation and failed drain retain loans. Public async stop retains PREPARED; only Platform cold stop returns hardware resources. Optional W25Q128JVSIQ uses six pads and 6Bh/eight dummy clocks for 1-1-4 quad read, independently of program DMA; adoption requires QE=1 and SUS=0, without status writes or resuming a foreign suspend. Indirect Flash endpoints forbid access to the 0x90000000 aperture throughout their lifetime. Optional `mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` combines only with the PIO controller, statically allocates 1..8 reader slots and authorizes only a live CPU loan range; it exposes no bypass Flash face, DMA reader or XIP. Failed final release retains cleanup responsibility only and permits no further reads; DDR/dual and automatic protection changes are not provided"

msgid "[间接 QuadSPI](../design/f407-fsmc.md)"
msgstr "[Indirect QuadSPI](../design/f407-fsmc.md)"

msgid "LTDC／DMA2D"
msgstr "LTDC/DMA2D"

msgid "F479NI 原生并行 RGB565／RGB888；RGB565／ARGB8888 内存，一／二 layer、2 active＋1 全局 pending。IRQ 在真实 blanking 锁存同代退休证明，task join 后才归还旧 frame；visible 不等于 SETTLED。独立 DMA2D 提供 fill／copy／convert／blend；所选 SDRAM 需显式 `graphics-owned` 连接并持有同一 bank lease。无 DSI、CLUT、隐藏 frame buffers 或对 FMC CPU-only 窗口的 DMA 授权"
msgstr "F479NI native parallel RGB565/RGB888; RGB565/ARGB8888 memory, one/two layers, 2 active plus 1 global pending frame. IRQ latches same-generation retirement proof at actual blanking; task join precedes returning an old frame. Visible is not SETTLED. Independent DMA2D provides fill/copy/convert/blend. Selected SDRAM requires an explicit `graphics-owned` connection and the same retained bank lease. No DSI, CLUT, hidden frame buffers or DMA authorization for the FMC CPU-only window"

msgid "[图形所有权](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#f479-ltdc-scanout-and-dma2d-memory-operations)"
msgstr "[Graphics ownership](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#f479-ltdc-scanout-and-dma2d-memory-operations)"

msgid "基础 CRYP／HASH"
msgstr "Basic CRYP/HASH"

msgid ""
"F415／F417 的有限 IRQ 或独立可选 DMA blocks：AES ECB／CBC／CTR、DES／TDES "
"ECB／CBC，SHA1／MD5／HMAC。DMA 使用精确双流 CRYP／三阶段 HMAC，memory TC 不等于 "
"engine／digest 完成；源与地址撤回、key／IV／context 清理后才结清。HASH DMA 输入／key 限正长度整 "
"word，digest 仍按字节；普通 hash 无 key。caller key 不擦除，无 worker／堆；不提供 DMA "
"空消息、字节尾部、原地 cipher overlap、AEAD 或 F479 增强 IP 资格"
msgstr ""
"F415/F417 finite IRQ or independently optional DMA blocks: AES "
"ECB/CBC/CTR, DES/TDES ECB/CBC, SHA1/MD5/HMAC. DMA uses exact dual-stream "
"CRYP/three-stage HMAC; memory TC does not mean engine/digest completion. "
"Settlement follows source and address withdrawal and key/IV/context "
"cleanup. HASH DMA input/key are limited to positive lengths of whole "
"words, while digests remain byte-aligned; ordinary hash has no key. "
"Caller keys are not erased; no workers/heap, DMA empty messages, byte "
"tails, in-place cipher overlap, AEAD or qualification for F479 enhanced "
"IP"

msgid "[F4 实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[F4 implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

