msgstr "Fixed CRC-32 numeric word sequences; actual UID, device / revision and Flash capacity. Data does not prove a complete ordering code, package identity or authentication secret"

msgid "[F4 CRC／身份](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"
msgstr "[F4 CRC / identity](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md)"

msgid "RNG"
msgstr "RNG"

msgid "唯一 typed RNG factory 与 Platform 生命周期；精确 PLL48 和活跃 System epoch，保留官方 seed／clock／连续值错误检查；不建立 DRBG、熵池或质量认证"
msgstr "One typed RNG factory and Platform lifecycle; exact PLL48 and a live System epoch, preserving official seed, clock and consecutive-value error checks; no DRBG, entropy pool or quality certification"

msgid "[RNG 时钟合同](../design/f407-system-power.md)、[公共 I/O](../reference/api/io.md)"
msgstr "[RNG clock contract](../design/f407-system-power.md), [Public I/O](../reference/api/io.md)"

msgid "CAN"
msgstr "CAN"

msgid "CAN1／2 classic IRQ、mailbox 与共享 filter domain；F407 不提供 CAN FD"
msgstr "CAN1 / 2 classic IRQ, mailboxes and a shared filter domain; F407 supplies no CAN FD"

msgid "[Classic CAN](../design/classic-can.md)"
msgstr "[Classic CAN](../design/classic-can.md)"

msgid "Ethernet"
msgstr "Ethernet"

msgid "VE／ZG MII 与 ZG RMII、独立 MDIO；raw `eth` 与增强 `eth_frames` 分选。已选 HCLK 为 25–168 MHz，MDC 与 PTP 20／40／80 ns 增量由计划推导。增强 face 提供整帧 SG、单 C-tag VLAN、显式 checksum offload 和 MAC 硬件事件／PTP 时间戳；这不建立同步或物理精度资格，PHY 接线、协议栈、同步与网络政策由外部提供"
msgstr "VE/ZG MII and ZG RMII with independent MDIO; raw `eth` and enhanced `eth_frames` are selected separately. Selected HCLK is 25–168 MHz; MDC division and the 20/40/80 ns PTP increment derive from the plan. The enhanced face provides whole-frame SG, one VLAN C-tag, explicit checksum offload and MAC hardware-event/PTP timestamps. This establishes no synchronization or physical-accuracy qualification. PHY wiring, protocol stacks, synchronization and network policy are external."

msgid "[Ethernet 帧](../design/ethernet-frames.md)、[MAC／MDIO](../design/ethernet.md)"
msgstr "[Ethernet frames](../design/ethernet-frames.md), [MAC / MDIO](../design/ethernet.md)"

msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

msgid ""
"FS／HS 引擎的 Device／Host、PIO 与 HS AHB DMA；Device 支持 control、bulk、interrupt "
"和单 transaction ISO packet。Device ISO 使用实际速度的帧窗口，接纳时剩余期限至多 1 秒，并满足受审 FIFO "
"分区；无 ACK／自动重试或周期调度。内部 PHY 仍为 FS，外部 ULPI 提供 HS／FS 回退；显式 managed roles 与按需 "
"ST 官方 Core 桥接；Host 可用 caller 存储显式绑定周期机会和保守带宽预算，early BUSY 不暴露旧 "
"DONE，无自动派发。同 epoch 提前零长 STATUS OUT 与 DATA IN 可并存，线上闭合后仍须双方向内存 join。不维护高带宽"
" ISO、自动 HNP／SRP 或 Host split。"
msgstr ""
"FS/HS Device/Host engines, PIO and HS AHB DMA. Device supports control, "
"bulk, interrupt and single-transaction ISO packets. Device ISO uses "
"actual-speed frame windows, accepts at most one second of remaining "
"deadline and requires reviewed FIFO partitioning; there is no ACK, "
"automatic retry or periodic scheduler. Internal PHY remains FS; external "
"ULPI provides HS/FS fallback. Explicit managed roles and optional ST "
"official Core bridges are available. Host can explicitly bind periodic "
"opportunities and conservative bandwidth budgets using caller storage; "
"early BUSY exposes no old DONE and dispatch is not automatic. Same-epoch "
"early zero-length STATUS OUT may coexist with DATA IN; both memory "
"directions must join after wire closure. High-bandwidth ISO, automatic "
"HNP/SRP and Host split remain unmaintained."

msgid "[USB 所有权](../design/usb-device.md)"
msgstr "[USB ownership](../design/usb-device.md)"

msgid "USB Device 远程唤醒"
msgstr "USB Device remote wake"

msgid "F407 的固定 Device 与 managed Device 阶段按需选择；FS、HS 内部 FS、ULPI 均由所选控制器的唯一 DCD 负责。host SET／CLEAR_FEATURE 在 STATUS IN 真实 ACK 后生效，取消或超时不撤销线上已提交作用。新 suspend 收条至少 5001 µs；有限 request 显式声明 service 延迟 B，满足 Core 时间／B 合同才证明 1–15 ms 信号。cancel／stop、拒撤或角色切换保留原 request／clock／pins，外部 USB 域失电或 CPU 停机不由该合同保证。共享 Flash 开销按实际链接另测"
msgstr "Selected as needed on F407 fixed Device or managed Device phases. FS, HS internal-FS and ULPI configurations each retain their selected controller's one DCD. Host SET/CLEAR_FEATURE takes effect only on the actual STATUS IN ACK; cancellation or timeout cannot undo the committed wire effect. A fresh suspend receipt must be at least 5001us old. The finite request declares service-delay bound B; satisfying Core time/B contracts proves a 1–15 ms signal. Cancel/stop, refused withdrawal and role changes retain the original request/clocks/pins. The contract does not cover external USB-domain power loss or CPU halt. Shared Flash costs require separate actual linked measurements."

msgid "[远程唤醒合同](../design/usb-device.md)"
msgstr "[Remote-wake contract](../design/usb-device.md)"

msgid "可选器件组件"
msgstr "Optional device components"

msgid "ILI9341 parallel16、XPT2046、W25 等通过公共端口访问；板级供电、存储分区和恢复政策由外部工程提供"
msgstr "ILI9341 parallel16, XPT2046, W25 and other components use public ports; Board power, storage partitions and recovery policy remain external"

msgid "[组件入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/README.md)、[I/O 所有权](../design/io-evolution.md)"
msgstr "[Components](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/README.md), [I/O ownership](../design/io-evolution.md)"

msgid "模式矩阵不穷举所有芯片功能的笛卡尔组合。未列出的格式、外部触发、共享资源和 后端组合必须由相应 provider 明确接入；不能从一种模式或公共 API 的存在推定。"
msgstr "The mode matrix does not enumerate every Cartesian combination of chip functions. Unlisted formats, external triggers, shared resources and backend combinations require explicit provider integration; support cannot be inferred from one mode or a public API."

msgid "选择、证据与来源"
msgstr "Selection, evidence and sources"

msgid "先确定精确型号和 Board 授权，再选择模式并通过 resolver 检查资源、内存域和时钟。 [派生能力表](capabilities.md)用于追踪声明、路线、装配和生产 ops；它不是第二份 配置输入，也不证明相关运行、排空或物理时序已通过。"
msgstr "Establish the exact part and Board authorization, then select a mode and pass the resolver's resource, memory-domain and clock checks. The [derived capability table](capabilities.md) traces declarations, routes, assemblies and production operations. It is neither a second configuration input nor proof that the corresponding execution, drain or physical timing passed."

msgid "以下为[前序 PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62)的固定历史结果， 仅覆盖各自精确配置；34 个消费者、165 条命令对应当时维护计划，不代表当前计划 或本轮新增模式验收。当前软件增量与验收见[交付导航](README.md)，按对应 PR 的精确源码、配置和原始结果读取。平台实现固定在 [`6b59f666`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/6b59f66628f0dbb415f6203ba917c1fe717bf3fd)； 最终 SDK 固定在 [`4bf4b5a2`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b)， 按 [当时的完整维护消费者计划](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b/tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py) 通过 34 个 消费者、165 条命令及搬移前后完整性校验。两提交仅差 TMP117 参考调用者的 I2C 字段迁移；四种 Native 编译输入未受影响的核查已记录。文档、ARM 和领域回归保留 原实际输入身份，不重标为最终 SDK 提交重新执行，也不扩大为全系列／全部模式通过。"
msgstr "The following are the fixed historical results of [earlier PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62), covering only their exact configurations. The 34 consumers and 165 commands belong to the maintained plan at that time; they do not represent the current plan or acceptance of newly added modes in this batch. For current software changes and acceptance, see the [delivery navigation](README.md) and read the corresponding PR's original results for its exact source and configuration. The platform implementation is fixed at [`6b59f666`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/6b59f66628f0dbb415f6203ba917c1fe717bf3fd), and the final SDK at [`4bf4b5a2`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b). Under the [complete maintained consumer plan at that time](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/4bf4b5a258b3120c24f6d834545ac3f300ce801b/tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py), it passed 34 consumers, 165 commands and integrity verification before and after relocation. The two commits differ only in the TMP117 reference caller's I2C field migration; the audit confirming unchanged compiler inputs for the four Native modes is recorded. Documentation, ARM and domain regressions retain their actual input identities, are not relabeled as new executions at the final SDK commit, and do not extend passes to the whole family or every mode."

msgid "源码维护、分组模型回归、ARM ELF、Source SDK、完整软件候选和物理 station 分别 建立证据，并绑定各自源码与配置。代理的 GREEN 或单个 ELF 不构成全候选通过。 当前 physical HIL 为 `not_executed`；未知 PCB、晶振精度、跳线、负载和波形保持未知。"
msgstr "Source maintenance, grouped model regressions, ARM ELF, Source SDK, whole software candidates and physical stations establish separate evidence bound to their own source and configuration. An agent's GREEN or a single ELF does not establish whole-candidate acceptance. Current physical HIL is `not_executed`; unknown PCBs, oscillator accuracy, jumpers, loads and waveforms remain unknown."

msgid "所有 vendor、子模块、锁与许可证保留。未选 SDK 不进入默认生产构建闭包； [器件目录](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json)只描述官方宏、启动和 IRQ 编译事实。 历史范围见[固定重构前源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)， 旧候选、计数和实板结果不重标为当前源码资格。"
msgstr "All vendors, submodules, locks and licenses are retained. Unselected SDKs do not enter the default production build closure. The [device catalogue](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json) describes official macro, startup and IRQ compilation facts only. Historical scope is available in the [fixed pre-refactor source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18); old candidates, counts and physical results are not relabeled as qualification for the current source."
